      en: ["The museum documents the arrival of Christianity in Samoa in 1830.", "It is owned and operated by the Congregational Christian Church of Samoa.", "The facility is located at the Malua Theological College campus.", "Exhibits include rare early editions of the Bible translated into Samoan.", "The building features a blend of modern architecture and traditional 'fale' style.", "It serves as a primary historical archive for the LMS (London Missionary Society) legacy."],
      es: ["El museo documenta la llegada del cristianismo a Samoa en 1830.", "Pertenece a la Congregational Christian Church of Samoa (EFKS).", "La instalación está en el Malua Theological College.", "Las piezas incluyen raras impresiones tempranas de la Biblia samoana.", "La arquitectura combina estilos modernos con el diseño 'Fale' tradicional.", "John Williams, el famoso misionero, es especialmente honrado aquí."],
      pt: ["O museu documenta a chegada do cristianismo a Samoa em 1830.", "Pertence à Congregational Christian Church of Samoa (EFKS).", "A instalação fica no Malua Theological College.", "As peças incluem raras impressões antigas da Bíblia samoana.", "A arquitetura combina estilos modernos com o design 'Fale' tradicional.", "John Williams, o famoso missionário, é especialmente homenageado aqui."],
